{"id": 996072, "slug": "rogue-hex", "name": "Rogue Hex", "name_original": "Rogue Hex", "description": "<p>More than a Roguelike + Deckbuilder + 4x Strategy game,<br/>Rogue Hex is something new...</p><p>🗺️ <strong>Scout</strong> procedural lands that shift beneath your feet.<br/>🗡️ <strong>Survive</strong> against the fierce barbarian horde.<br/>🎆 <strong>Discover</strong> deep systems and powerful combos.</p><p>🧪 <strong>Mix</strong> over 200 game-changing technologies.<br/>🎲 <strong>Improvise</strong> to make the most of each unique run.<br/>❄️ <strong>Watch</strong> your choices snowball, creating wildly different civilizations.</p><p>🎴 <strong>Draft</strong> your perfect deck of cards to craft a unique strategy.<br/>🔨 <strong>Upgrade</strong> your cards, units and cities in every era.<br/>📈 <strong>Build</strong> an empire to stand the test of time, from the stone age to the singularity.</p><p>🏆 <strong>Achieve</strong> tough challenges to reveal new content.<br/>✨ <strong>Unlock</strong> permanent upgrades between matches.<br/>⚰️ <strong>Die</strong> in spectacular fashion, and try again!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-01-13", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-08-27T13:22:19", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b4f/b4faa0da2277d397b93ec582214138ca.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/e8b/e8b4684e8daaf4d298e3bab39463c3e8.jpg", "website": "http://www.roguehex.com/press/index.php", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 5, "added_by_status": {"yet": 1, "owned": 1, "beaten": 1, "toplay": 2}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 42, "parent_achievements_count": 42, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "